  "cache:posts": {
    "entries": {
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ahad-khan-hrmanager_were-hiring-nodejs-developer-12-years-activity-7462111595511312384-LkQT": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T06:58:15.093353+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "🚀 We're Hiring: Node.js Developer (1–2 Years Exp.)\nCompany: Bitrupt\nLocation: Saddar, Karachi (Near Press Club) – On-site\n\nThe Role\nWe aren't looking for a corporate robot. We need a rising backend builder who lives in Node.js, breathes APIs, and is ready to write code that actually impacts real products. If you have 1 to 2 years of solid experience and love solving puzzles behind the screen, let’s talk.\n\nWhat You’ll Bring to the Table\nNode.js Mastery: You know your way around Express.js (or NestJS) and event-driven architecture.\nDatabase Comfort: You can talk to MongoDB or SQL databases without breaking a sweat.\nAPI Crafting: You build clean, secure, and fast RESTful APIs.\nProblem-Solving: You don't just find bugs; you crush them.\n\nWhy Bitrupt?\nWork right in the heart of Karachi (Saddar), easily accessible from anywhere.\nFast-paced environment with zero corporate red tape.\nMassive room for quick professional and financial growth.\n\nDrop Your Specs!\n📧 Email: Send your resume to careers@bitrupt.co\n👉 Use Subject: Node.js Developer - [Your Name]\n📞 WhatsApp / Call: 0303-2518858",
          "posted_at": "2026-05-18T12:07:23.677Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/alijawaid_were-hiring-front-end-developer-nextjs-share-7522952555707121664-0UnO": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T06:58:15.093353+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "• WE'RE HIRING: Front-End Developer (Next.js)\n●-\nLocation: Near Jail Chowrangi, Karachi\nJob Type: Full-Time | On-Site\nWorking Hours: 10:00 AM - 7:00 PM\nWorking Days: Monday - Saturday\nExperience: Minimum 2 Years\n\nAre you passionate about creating beautiful, modern, and pixel-perfect web interfaces?\nBizwave Consultancy is looking for a creative Front-End Developer with strong technical skills and an excellent eye for\nUI/UX design. We need someone who can do more than write code someone who can turn ideas into engaging digital experiences!\nKey Requirements\nStrong experience with Next.js, React.js, and TypeScript.\nExcellent command of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Tailwind CSS.\nStrong understanding of UI/UX principles, typography, spacing, colors, and visual hierarchy.\nAbility to create and improve Ul designs independently.\nExperience converting Figma designs into responsive, pixel-perfect interfaces.\nKnowledge of SEO, website performance, and cross-browser compatibility.\nExperience with animations using Framer Motion or GSAP is a plus.\nExperience working with ERP systems is an added advantage.\nStrong problem-solving and communication skills.\n\nKey Responsibilities\nDevelop and maintain modern, responsive web applications using Next.js.\nBuild clean, intuitive, and visually appealing user interfaces.\nSuggest and implement UI/UX improvements.\nCollaborate with designers and backend developers.\nOptimize website performance, speed, and usability.\n\nHow to Apply\nInterested candidates are encouraged to share their CV along with their portfolio, GitHub profile, or live project links.\nApply Now: career@bizwaveconsultancy.com\nIf you have the right mix of technical expertise and creative vision, we'd love to hear from you!\nKnow someone who would be a great fit? Share this post\nor tag them in the comments!",
          "posted_at": "2026-11-02T09:27:39.632Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/hira-wahid-437ab0267_we-are-hiring-position-nodejs-developer-activity-7464631549171347458-EXue": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T06:58:15.093353+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "🚀 We are Hiring!!!!\n\nPosition: Node.js Developer\nExperience: Fresh – 1 Year\n\n📍 Location: DHA Phase 2 Ext, Karachi.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\nDevelop and maintain backend applications using Node.js\nBuild and integrate REST APIs\nDebug and troubleshoot application issues\nCollaborate with development teams\nWork with databases and third-party integrations\n\nRequirements:\n\nBachelor’s degree in Computer Science or related field\nGood understanding of JavaScript and Node.js\nFamiliarity with Express.js and REST APIs\nBasic knowledge of MongoDB/MySQL\nUnderstanding of Git/version control is a plus\nGood problem-solving and communication skills\n\n📩 Interested candidates can share their resumes at hira.wahid@cee-solutions.com or hr@resourcelinked.tech with the position mentioned in the subject line",
          "posted_at": "2026-05-25T11:00:47.451Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/karachi-jobsz_were-hiring-web-developer-frontend-php-activity-7476920524120604672-0VQx": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T06:58:15.093353+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "We're Hiring: Web Developer (Frontend + PHP / Next.js)\n\nPARADIGM DIGITAL SOLUTIONS (PVT) LTD is looking for a skilled Web Developer to build, maintain, and keep our websites running in top shape.\n\nIf you write clean code, care about performance, and like owning a site end-to-end, we'd love to hear from you.\n\nWhat we're looking for:\nStrong hands-on experience with HTML and CSS\nSolid PHP development skills\nProven experience with Next.js (and React, which it's built on)\nExperience with site health management diagnosing and fixing technical issues, performance monitoring, and general upkeep\nAttention to detail and a problem-solving mindset\nAbility to work independently and meet deadlines\n\n📍 Location: DMCHS, Karachi (Onsite)\n🕘 Shift Timing: 8:00 PM – 5:00 AM\n🏢 Job Type: Onsite, Full-time\n\nSend your resume and portfolio to hr@paradigmdigitals.com",
          "posted_at": "2026-06-28T08:52:47.387Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/shahidahmedhod_were-hiring-frontend-developer-nextjs-activity-7457038491210686464-qDTI": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T06:58:15.093353+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "We’re Hiring: Frontend Developer (Next.js)\n\nLocation: Karachi (On-site)\n\nWe are seeking a skilled Frontend Developer (Next.js) to join our team. If you are passionate about building modern, high-performance web applications, this is a great opportunity to grow your career.\n\n🔹 Key Responsibilities:\nDevelop and maintain web applications using Next.js and React\nBuild responsive and user-friendly interfaces\nCollaborate with cross-functional teams\nOptimize applications for speed and scalability\nWrite clean, maintainable, and reusable code\n\n🔹 Requirements:\nHands-on experience with Next.js and React.js\nStrong command of JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5, and CSS3\nExperience with API integration (REST/GraphQL)\nFamiliarity with Git/version control\nUnderstanding of performance optimization\n\n📩 How to Apply:\n Share your resume and portfolio at Jobs@imtiaz.com.pk",
          "posted_at": "2026-05-04T12:08:41.364Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sherin-lee-joseph_hiring-angular-developer-nodejs-nextjs-activity-7463223113414168577-lRUk": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T06:58:15.093353+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Hiring: Angular Developer | Node.js | Next.js\nLocation: Karachi, Pakistan\nExperience: 4–6 Years\nJob Type: Full-Time\n\nWe are looking for a talented Angular Developer with strong experience in Node.js and Next.js to join our growing development team.\n\nRequired Skills:Angular,Node.js,Next.js,TypeScript\nREST APIs,MongoDB / PostgreSQL,Git\n\nResponsibilities: \nBuild scalable web applications\nDevelop responsive frontend interfaces\nCreate backend APIs using Node.js\nCollaborate with designers and developers\nOptimize application performance and scalability\n\nInterested candidates can apply - DM/email(sherin_lee@mvisionit.com)",
          "posted_at": "2026-05-21T13:44:10.171Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/shoaibahmedbaig_hiring-a-developer-gulshan-e-iqbal-karachi-activity-7496872928731426817-mDma": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T06:58:15.093353+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Hiring a developer. Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. On-site.\n\nNext.js, TypeScript, Postgres.\n\nReal system. Thousands of orders a day, real money, no staging, work in production...\n\nPlease Claude Code is not a skill. Knowing when it's wrong -> is.\n\nMinimum 3 years.\n\nSalary: 90k–150k\n\nCV to shoaib@elyscents.pk  and tell me one bug you found that everyone else said wasn't there.\n\nJazakAllah",
          "posted_at": "2026-08-22T10:16:31.308Z"
        }
      },
      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/talent-hub-sol_talenthubsol-hiring-frontenddeveloper-activity-7523089799058972673-WDb4": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T06:58:15.093353+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Bizwave Consultancy Pvt Ltd : Front-End Developer (Next.js)\n\nLocation: Near Jail Chowrangi, *Karachi\nJob Type: Full-Time | On-Site\nWorking Hours: 10:00 AM – 7:00 PM\nWorking Days: Monday – Saturday\nExperience: Minimum 2 Years\n\nAre you passionate about creating beautiful, modern, and pixel-perfect web interfaces?\nBizwave Consultancy is looking for a creative Front-End Developer with strong technical skills and an excellent eye for\nUI/UX design. We need someone who can do more than write code someone who can turn ideas into engaging digital experiences!\n\nKey Requirements\nStrong experience with Next.js, React.js, and TypeScript.\nExcellent command of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Tailwind CSS.\nStrong understanding of UI/UX principles, typography, spacing, colors, and visual hierarchy.\nAbility to create and improve Ul designs independently.\nExperience converting Figma designs into responsive, pixel-perfect interfaces.\nKnowledge of SEO, website performance, and cross-browser compatibility.\nExperience with animations using Framer Motion or GSAP is a plus.\nExperience working with ERP systems is an added advantage.\nStrong problem-solving and communication skills.\n\nKey Responsibilities\nDevelop and maintain modern, responsive web applications using Next.js.\nBuild clean, intuitive, and visually appealing user interfaces.\nSuggest and implement UI/UX improvements.\nCollaborate with designers and backend developers.\nOptimize website performance, speed, and usability.\n\nApply now\nhttps://lnkd.in/dyEUKbkm\n\nFor more jobs alerts follow Talent Hub Sol\nhttps://lnkd.in/dsvw29Vt\n\n#TalentHubSol #Hiring #FrontEndDeveloper #NextJS #ReactJS #TypeScript #WebDeveloper #FrontendJobs #KarachiJobs #PakistanJobs #ITJobs #SoftwareDevelopment #UIUXDesign #TailwindCSS #JavaScript #TechCareers #JobOpportunity #ApplyNow #BizwaveConsultancy",
          "posted_at": "2026-11-02T18:33:00.344Z"
        }
      }
    },
